 No decisive source-external runtime fact is required within this declared boundary because the requested root binding, permission outcome, and existence are supplied as task premises, while the source path establishes the gate and protected effect. This is source_supported_failure, not a repository-wide completeness claim; source discovery remains not-tested.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"DocumentViewSet.download dispatches the requested download to file_response with attachment disposition.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7632cecb669d34e1","startLine":1834,"endLine":1839}]},{"id":"f-identity-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The authorization check uses request.user as the caller identity when resolving the requested document.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7632cecb669d34e1","startLine":1401,"endLine":1427}]},{"id":"f-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The requested pk is bound to request_doc, and root_doc is derived from that requested document before authorization.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7632cecb669d34e1","startLine":1410,"endLine":1420}]},{"id":"f-root-control","kind":"control","statement":"The strongest visible authorization control applies has_perms_owner_aware to root_doc with view_document and returns forbidden when it fails.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7632cecb669d34e1","startLine":1421,"endLine":1427}]},{"id":"f-owner-aware-semantics","kind":"control","statement":"The owner-aware check succeeds only when the object has no owner, the object owner is the user, or the object-level permission check succeeds.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-18b8f193a13de576","startLine":624,"endLine":635}]},{"id":"f-gate-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"The file-serving path is conditional on the root authorization gate not returning HttpResponseForbidden.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7632cecb669d34e1","startLine":1429,"endLine":1437}]},{"id":"f-protected-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"Only after the gate does the handler select file_doc and call serve_file with that document.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7632cecb669d34e1","startLine":1435,"endLine":1443}]},{"id":"f-served-file","kind":"effect","statement":"serve_file serves the selected document's archive_file when archive use is enabled, otherwise its source_file.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7632cecb669d34e1","startLine":4941,"endLine":4965}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":4982,"output":1065,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":29969.902300000016,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-29T19:09:02.582Z"}}
